Z||000009||Rick 88||09-20-2001||04:07 PM||||Thanks guys! I know have the "official" name for the color of my car. It is original paint and only needs small touch ups except for the nose which has some chips. I want to respray it and possibly color key the side mouldings. <P>Slyguy<BR>I took off the black wheels and installed 17in ALT AT-148 wheels because I though it looked like a bumblebee also. Big difference!<P>I sold my white 88 GT which I really liked when if found the yellow one. My friends used to call my white car "The Generic One" I can't say the yellow one is faster, but it draws even more attention than the white one did. Some people think it is a new car since there are a lot of cars currently offered in yellow.<P>No blending into traffic for me now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Rick 88<P>||||reg||7
